    "review_note": "CORRECTION (pending two-person clinical sign-off): the 'untestable' options (amputation/joint fusion for motor arm/leg items 5-6, intubation/physical barrier for dysarthria item 10) previously carried the data-entry sentinel value 9, which the summing scorer added to the total and could inflate a mild stroke into a severe one. Per standard NIHSS scoring these are untestable and are not added to the total, so they now contribute 0."
